  'Purchase order': { what: 'The order\'s vendor, dates, reference, place of supply, how its bills are matched and its tolerances, and what is still to receive and bill.', how: 'The tolerances say how far above the order price a bill may be, and how much more than ordered may be received or billed, before it needs an approver.' },
  'Goods received': { what: 'Each delivery recorded against the order (a goods receipt, GRN): the date, the vendor\'s delivery note, what was accepted and rejected, and who recorded it.', how: 'Record goods received… adds one. A receipt entered by mistake is cancelled with a reason, unless posted bills already rely on it.' },
